munity Fund!","meta_twitter_description":"El ecosistema Stellar abre nuevamente las puertas a quienes están construyendo el futuro de la Web3, con una nueva ronda del Stellar Community Fund (SCF). Esta vez, el fondo ofrece hasta USD $150,000 por proyecto, destinados a ideas que aprovechen el potencial de Stellar y su entorno de contratos inteligentes, Soroban.","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":"default","enforce_gated_content":true,"enable_popup_on_scroll":false,"email_capture_title":"Suscríbete para seguir leyendo","email_capture_message":"Este contenido es gratuito, pero debes estar suscrito a Tellus Cooperative para continuar leyendo.","email_capture_cta":"Suscríbete","estimated_reading_time":2,"estimated_reading_time_display":"2 minutos","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12","name":"Pau Koh","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/pau_headshot_1.png","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/thumb_pau_headshot_1.png"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/landscape_pau_headshot_1.png"}},"bio":"𝘊𝘔𝘎𝘙/𝘛𝘦𝘭𝘭𝘶𝘴 𝘊𝘰𝘰𝘱𝘦𝘳𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘷𝘦","twitter_handle":"kl0ren","facebook_url":null,"instagram_url":null,"linkedin_url":null,"tiktok_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"discord_url":null,"bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[{"id":"f3f92fa9-b675-4f89-a63c-515c1a62637a","display":"Información","slug":"informacion"}],"created_at":"2025-07-02T18:41:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T18:50:45Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"qu-es-el-scf\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">📌</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> ¿Qué es el SCF?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar Community Fund</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> es un programa de financiamiento abierto y descentralizado, donde la comunidad juega un rol clave en seleccionar los proyectos ganadores. Está pensado para desarrolladores, diseñadores, startups y cualquier persona con una idea potente.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">A diferencia de otros fondos corporativos, el SCF pone a la comunidad en el centro: todos pueden participar, opinar y votar.</span></p></div><div id=\"quin-puede-postular\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">✅</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> ¿Quién puede postular?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Cualquier persona o equipo que esté trabajando o quiera comenzar un proyecto en Stellar. No importa si estás comenzando o ya tienes un MVP. Algunos ejemplos:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">DApps DeFi o plataformas de intercambio</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Herramientas educativas o wallets</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Soluciones para inclusión financiera</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Integraciones con Soroban</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Proyectos de impacto social</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"calendario-oficial-de-scf-38\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">🗓️ Calendario oficial de SCF #38:</span></h3></div><div class=\"b7oqx90\" style=\"--cell-width:14.285714285714286%\"><table class=\"b7oqx91\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"_200kro0\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Etapa</span></p></div></th><th class=\"_200kro0\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Fecha</span></p></div></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Envío de abstract</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">10 junio – 20 julio 2025</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Revisión inicial</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">21 julio – 25 julio</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Subida de build</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">25 julio – 10 agosto</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Evaluación de panel</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">11 agosto – 17 agosto</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Votación comunitaria</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">18 agosto – 25 agosto</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Anuncio y entrega de premios</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">26 agosto – 2 septiembre</span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id=\"dnde-postular\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">🛠️ ¿Dónde postular?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Puedes registrarte y subir tu proyecto en el sitio oficial:</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">👉 </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/awards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\"><strong>communityfund.stellar.org/awards</strong></a></span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ahí mismo encontrarás recursos, criterios de evaluación y ejemplos de rondas pasadas.</span></p></div><div id=\"por-qu-postular-al-scf\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🌐</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> ¿Por qué postular al SCF?</span></h3></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">💸</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Financiamiento real: hasta </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>USD $150K</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> por proyecto</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">🌍 Visibilidad global en el ecosistema Stellar</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">🛠️ Feedback técnico y acompañamiento</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🧠</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Comunidad activa que apoya y evalúa</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Desde la Cooperativa te animamos a participar.</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Esta es una oportunidad única para visibilizar y escalar tu proyecto en una blockchain que realmente está conectando con LATAM. ¡Inscríbete antes del 20 de julio y empieza a construir el futuro!</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/2SHteza5dJ\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¡Únete al servidor de Discord Tellus Cooperative!</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Echa un vistazo a la comunidad Tellus Cooperative en Discord. Pasa el rato con 106 miembros y disfruta de chat de voz y texto gratis.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">discord.gg/2SHteza5dJ</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/splashes/871845192058146906/969229c90c917d6b7cc7d7ba70379861.jpg?size=512\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/GURXILGTaOMLCVfKgUHnNc\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¡Únete a la comu